Möbius Walkers (Paradoxian God Machine)
Forged on the spiraling world of Yith, the Möbius Walkers are not built to wage war but to unravel it. Their mirrored bodies twist like endless Möbius strips, inscribed with the Necronomium’s prophecy of “The Knot that Binds Eternity.” 
Unlike the Solar Colossus or Dreadnut, they do not march as titans but fold reality into themselves. 
Soldiers speak of them appearing in battles centuries before their forging, of strikes that erase the very moment they were made, and of machines that return from destruction because they never truly fell.
To face the Möbius Walkers is to fight against the collapse of causality itself.
